(text "Raspberry Pi Pico UART fixture - rev A" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7a2616a4-7a85-5cec-a135-fe2ae402857c"))
(text "U1: Raspberry Pi Pico SC0915 + 2 x TSW-120-07-G-S headers, fitted in J1/J2 with USB facing board edge Y=0.\nPico USB is the only power input. Carrier has no 5 V or 3V3 rail.\nPico on-board LED is GP25. SWD and BOOTSEL are accessible after lid removal." (at 25.4 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aa52a43d-5fd1-520e-a2cd-0d61267657b4"))
(text "J1 pins 1..20 = Pico pins 1..20.\n1=GP0/TX, 2=GP1/RX\n3/8/13/18=GND\nAll other contacts intentionally NC." (at 25.4 118.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "395992b2-a55b-5575-a7b3-866a868fb9b6"))
(text "J2 pins 1..20 = Pico pins 40..21.\n3=Pico38 GND, 8=Pico33 AGND\n13=Pico28 GND, 18=Pico23 GND\nAll other contacts intentionally NC." (at 109.22 118.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "111172dc-6982-55d9-a52d-2858175ce1f2"))
(text "J3 mates Adafruit 954 USB-TTL cable:\n1 GND -> black\n2 Pico TX -> white (host RX)\n3 Pico RX <- green (host TX)\nRED 5 V WIRE MUST STAY DISCONNECTED.\n115200 baud, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit." (at 188 84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8500f0ce-7f12-5286-b532-bbe5474c6ba5"))
(text "60 x 70 x 1.6 mm, two copper layers.\nFour 2.9 mm NPTH holes at (4,4), (56,4), (4,66), (56,66) mm.\nM2.5 hardware, 3.5 mm copper keepout radius.\nNo physical measurements or hardware qualification recorded for rev A." (at 25.4 163.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "45d5cd2b-78ff-59c6-aa06-12e17202e5e9"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
